---
import { heroHighlights } from '../data/homepage';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-stone-300/60 bg-[#f7f4ec]/55">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute -right-24 top-8 h-[520px] w-[520px] rounded-full border border-brand-900/10"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-2 top-24 h-[390px] w-[390px] rounded-full border border-brand-900/[0.07]"></div>
    <div class="absolute right-28 top-48 h-[160px] w-[160px] rounded-full bg-brand-600/[0.05] blur-2xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-800/20 to-transparent"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-xl relative py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr]">
      <div class="animate-in">
        <div class="mb-7 flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] text-brand-700">
          <span class="h-px w-9 bg-brand-600"></span>
          2026年最新 · 独立测速与科学上网机场评测指南
        </div>

        <h1 class="max-w-4xl font-serif text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.035em] text-ink sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          2026 翻墙机场推荐
          <span class="mt-3 block font-normal text-brand-700">便宜好用的 VPN 机场评测与梯子指南</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl border-l border-brand-500/60 pl-5 text-base leading-[1.9] text-stone-600 sm:text-lg">
          专业翻墙梯子与魔法科学上网评测平台。实测对比 30+ 优质 IEPL/IPLC 专线机场，提供独家节点测速、流媒体与 AI 解锁数据，助您快速挑选最稳定靠谱的上网线路。
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#featured-brands" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-ink bg-ink px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#fbf8f0] transition-all hover:border-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-700">
            查看 Top 3 推荐机场
            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/compare/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 border border-stone-300 bg-[#fbf8f0]/70 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700 transition-all hover:border-brand-500 hover:text-brand-800">
            横向对比参数矩阵
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 border-t border-stone-300/70 pt-5 text-xs text-stone-500">
          {['不接受厂商付费赞助', '晚高峰真实环境实测', '外链中转加密保护'].map((item) => (
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-600"></span>
              {item}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="animate-in delay-200 relative mx-auto w-full max-w-md">
        <div class="absolute -left-8 -top-8 font-serif text-7xl text-brand-900/[0.06]" aria-hidden="true">澜</div>
        <div class="border border-stone-300/80 bg-[#fbf8f0]/72 p-6 shadow-[0_30px_80px_rgba(56,68,60,0.10)] backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-300/70 pb-4">
            <div>
              <p class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-ink">评测四则</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-[10px] tracking-[0.16em] text-stone-400">EVALUATION NOTES</p>
            </div>
            <span class="font-serif text-3xl text-brand-500">水</span>
          </div>

          <div class="divide-y divide-stone-200/80">
            {heroHighlights.map((item, index) => (
              <div class="group grid grid-cols-[38px_1fr_auto] items-center gap-3 py-5">
                <span class="font-serif text-xs text-brand-500">0{index + 1}</span>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-stone-700 transition-colors group-hover:text-brand-800">{item.text}</p>
                <span class="h-5 w-5 rounded-full border border-brand-300 transition-all group-hover:scale-125 group-hover:border-brand-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <p class="border-t border-stone-300/70 pt-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-stone-500">
            基于持续测速、线路验证与解锁状态记录形成的综合评估。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
